{"translation-revision-date":"2026-07-30 17:28","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"assets\/js\/admin\/build-with-ai.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"it_IT","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"Get started":[""],"Copied!":[""],"Build an email with AI":[""],"Describe the email you want and your AI assistant writes it, ready for you to review and edit.":[""],"A welcome email for new newsletter subscribers that links to our three most popular blog posts.":[""],"When it's done, you'll find the email in your emails list as a draft.":[""],"Set up with AI":[""],"Describe your business and what you want, and your AI assistant sets everything up for you, asking for anything it needs.":[""],"I run a yoga studio. I want a newsletter signup form on my website, a welcome email for new subscribers, and a monthly schedule email.":[""],"When it's done, your assistant gives you a list of anything left for you to do, like connecting your email service.":[""],"Build a flow with AI":[""],"Describe the automation you want and your AI assistant builds the flow, ready for you to review and edit.":[""],"When someone fills out the contact form, send a thank you email, wait two days, then follow up if they haven't booked a call.":[""],"When it's done, you'll find the flow in your flows list. It stays inactive until you turn it on.":[""],"Edit this flow with AI":[""],"After the welcome email, wait three days and send a follow-up to anyone who hasn't clicked yet.":[""],"When it's done, reload this page to see the changes. If the flow is active, they wait for you to publish them.":[""],"Edit this email with AI":[""],"Make it shorter and friendlier, and add a button to book a call after the second paragraph.":[""],"Save your own changes before you start. When it's done, reload this page to see the changes.":[""],"Ask me what I want before you start.":[""],"Start from an example:":[""],"Connect your AI assistant":[""],"First, connect your AI assistant":[""],"Your assistant needs a connection to this site before it can build anything for you. It takes a few minutes, and you only do it once.":[""],"Waiting for your assistant to connect. This moves on by itself once it does.":[""],"I've already connected one":[""],"Next, you'll describe what you want and copy a prompt into your assistant.":[""],"Your assistant is connected. Now tell it what to build.":[""],"1. Describe what you want":[""],"2. Copy this prompt into your AI assistant":[""],"Works with any assistant that supports MCP, like ChatGPT, Claude, Cursor or Gemini.":[""],"Copy prompt":[""]}}}